{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p052a","title":"何曾奏请为司马懿选置副帅","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p052a-account","label":"裴注·魏名臣奏","text":"何曾奏请为司马懿选置副帅","evidence":["mingdi-e-p052a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0097","role":"建议","evidence":["mingdi-e-p052a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":238,"label":"景初二年征辽东时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y238","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o059","basis":"景初二年征辽东时"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-p052a-q","mingdi-q-o059","mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-p052a-q","source_order":[3,454,"P052a"],"order":948}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0097","name":"何曾","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p052a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-473a848d67e470e277d8","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏名臣奏》载散骑常侍何曾表曰：“臣闻先王制法，必于全慎。故建官授任，则置假辅；陈师命将，则立监贰；宣命遣使，则设介副；临敌交刃，则参御右。盖以尽谋思之功，防安危之变也。是以在险当难，则权足相济；陨缺不预，则才足相代：其为固防，至深至远。及至汉氏，亦循旧章。韩信伐赵，张耳为贰；马援讨越，刘隆副军。前世之迹，著在篇志。今懿奉辞诛罪，步骑数万；道路回阻，四千余里；虽假天威，有征无战，寇或潜遁，消散日月；命无常期，人非金石；远虑详备，诚宜有副。今北边诸将及懿所督，皆为僚属。名位不殊，素无定分；猝有变急，不相镇摄。存不忘亡，圣达所戒，宜选大臣名将威重宿著者，盛其礼秩，遣诣懿军；进同谋略，退为副佐。虽有万一不虞之灾，军主有储，则无患矣。”","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":453,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ae808f022b9e739ca93c","start":0,"end":318,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
